  "body": "Seems fairly obvious to me that we don't want disgruntled users sending endless reports for each event in a room, and screwing up genuine metrics on room reports. Obviously this can backfire in that sometimes there *is* a lot to report, but perhaps that should be addressed in a way that doesn't involve lots of calls to this API.",
